  100.000 H2 capability counter=2 stamp=100.000
  110.000 H7 heartbeat counter=12 stamp=110.000 corrupt
  110.000 N2 fault E2E_VERIFY_FAIL
  120.000 H7 heartbeat counter=13 stamp=120.000 corrupt
  120.000 N2 fault E2E_VERIFY_FAIL
